      "text": "Sun event is EV18 (Shade the sun). It had no min_cycle, so it could fire at the first event slot, cycle 5."
    },
    {
      "id": "F-forecast",
      "agent": "ui-programmer",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "text": "Route income is not a route field: a route only moves goods to the destination storage (plus upgrade bonus and stop sale); the credits come from the Sell order at the destination, which settle() runs after the routes. The old forecast priced Sell orders on today's storage (empty), so it missed everything routes deliver. Fixed with read-only RouteEngine.forecast(cash)."
    }
  ],
  "decisions": [
    {
      "id": "D1",
      "agent": "gameplay-programmer",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
