    },
    {
      "id": "D-reserve-rebalance",
      "agent": "economy-designer",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "text": "Claimed and done: starting_credits 1800 to 2100 (data_version 22). Cause: reserve delays ship 3 from cycle 3 to 7-10. QA re-run needed: seeds 1-8, fast clock, decent/mining_focus/always_expand. See handoffs/economy-designer/2026-11-02-reserve-rebalance.json"
    },
