    {
      "id": "D-alpha-economy",
      "agent": "economy-designer",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "text": "Done: tools/sim.py --settle mirrors settle + reserve + QA bots (matches v5 real runs). Tuned ship_cap 24 to 6, win_cash 8500 to 11500, trip_cost 95 to 90, Voltara ore_sell 11 to 12 (balance data_version 24, planets 8). Mirror: decent 91% median 26. Owner question: ship_cap is now the real limiter. QA round 1 run in handoffs/economy-designer/2026-11-02-alpha-economy.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "D-alpha-fix-r2",
      "agent": "gameplay-programmer",
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "text": "Mining: B1 is gated by neither permit-first nor first-row rule (cost 1, start point). Deadlock: when cash < trip fixed cost and no route has run yet this cycle, the first route flies for the cash left (RouteEngine.fare_for); route_reserve keeps that cash from Buys."
