      "agent": "main",
      "text": "Owner (2026-11-02): accept decent at 2 of 8 wins as the hard strategy; mining as the faster strategy (median 25 vs decent 28.5) is acceptable. Alpha goal closed on this basis. No buy gate. Known gap: decent 2 of 8 vs 6 of 8 target."
